      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also a mute that dances in front of mirrors. I can't say I've ever been blocked for minding my own business. Even if I have been, how would I know about it? There isn't any indication that somebody's blocked you besides them suddenly not appearing in the world. I absolutely agree that the trust system needs a huge overhaul, and personally I don't think blocking should affect your trust ranking, but in my own experience I haven't really seen this kind of behavior before",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-06-05T20:23:22.238Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think the blocking system and trust system needs a major over hall. I'm more often than not have my mic muted. And I get blocked for no reason. I'm improving my dancing skills at a mirror while muted I get blocked. I'm hanging out with a friend and the people that are harrassing me block me when I dont react to their harrassing. I think blocking shouldnt affect your trust rank because people block you for the smallest thing. Using an avatar that person doesnt like? BLOCKED. And blocking affects your rank as far as I know. So A rework would be great.",
